{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1022045-mind-dream-purviews","id":1022045,"title":"Mind/Dream Purviews?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-25T11:34:42-08:00","id":1022045,"title":"Mind/Dream Purviews?","content":"Hi guys!<br /> Does anyone know of a good and balanced Mind or Dream purview? Recently I've been reading Sandman and having some ideas, but nothing in Scion really gets where I want to go.<br /> Anyway, thanks beforehand, happy holidays!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4533-havoc","name":"Havoc","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-25T12:10:05-08:00","id":1022050,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Havoc</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1022045-mind-dream-purviews#post1022045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi guys!<br /> Does anyone know of a good and balanced Mind or Dream purview? Recently I've been reading Sandman and having some ideas, but nothing in Scion really gets where I want to go.<br /> Anyway, thanks beforehand, happy holidays!</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think I have seen any really detailed one done up before, but what I will suggest is actually using the Illusion Purview. Illusion works wonders as a Purview for Dream Deities. There are so few that an entire Purview for them is a lot of effort for little use, but Illusion fills the gap wonderfully. All that is needed is giving the Illusion Purview a Boon that allows 'entering' a dream, and you are sorted. Allow the Illusion Boons to craft the dreamscape for free, or drastically reduced costs, etc.<br /> <br /> Now, this <i>also</i> allows actual Illusions to be re-fluffed as daydreams, or similar. Technically, a pure and proper Dream Purview would be very... niche, needing targets to be asleep before you get to use your Purview. However, basing it off the Illusion Purview, with Illusions re-fluffed as daydreams, or other hallucinations allows Dream Scions to be more functional in the waking world, and allows them to actually flex their divine muscles on screen more often. (Also, there is a problem where if Dream can only interact with dreams, the rest of the Band has to be benched to some degree while the Dream Scion plays around. This way really prevents some tricky situations)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Scion 2e Homebrew Projects:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUnAIZEDk4Zs_W0ELfffeFRAiSel3nAl/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The \u0160iune\u0161</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MMw0vBmHdvuGUbVhyFw7BpXT49UgECnR/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Enduri</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CZuVp5VuftwuwHtzrWADqIaq7Vl-LMIr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Sg\u0101\u2019na Qeda\u2019s</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17piJ8ZBzvt4PL47vz5Gw3BF6HOZelrfh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Abosom</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rk9BKLqbUEroFDvuPSQOwp-pBRxSvN9P/view\" target=\"_blank\">The Zemi</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/324026/Nemetondevos-Revised\" target=\"_blank\">Nemetondevos: Revised</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325461/Mysteries-of-the-Otherworld\" target=\"_blank\">Mysteries of the Otherworld</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/394-watcher","name":"Watcher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"662"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-25T12:16:05-08:00","id":1022053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Watcher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1022045-mind-dream-purviews?p=1022050#post1022050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't think I have seen any really detailed one done up before, but what I will suggest is actually using the Illusion Purview. Illusion works wonders as a Purview for Dream Deities. There are so few that an entire Purview for them is a lot of effort for little use, but Illusion fills the gap wonderfully. All that is needed is giving the Illusion Purview a Boon that allows 'entering' a dream, and you are sorted. Allow the Illusion Boons to craft the dreamscape for free, or drastically reduced costs, etc.<br /> <br /> Now, this <i>also</i> allows actual Illusions to be re-fluffed as daydreams, or similar. Technically, a pure and proper Dream Purview would be very... niche, needing targets to be asleep before you get to use your Purview. However, basing it off the Illusion Purview, with Illusions re-fluffed as daydreams, or other hallucinations allows Dream Scions to be more functional in the waking world, and allows them to actually flex their divine muscles on screen more often. (Also, there is a problem where if Dream can only interact with dreams, the rest of the Band has to be benched to some degree while the Dream Scion plays around. This way really prevents some tricky situations)</div> </div> </div> </div>I hadn't thought of that, thanks!<br /> That may lead to some interesting things. Recently I've been fiddling with the underlying mythology, the Scion mythology, in my game, and that would include a sort of &quot;Collective Unconscious&quot;, just like the Anima Mundi in the original WoD. But yeah, Illusion would work very well with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4533-havoc","name":"Havoc","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-25T21:39:05-08:00","id":1022214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Havoc</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1022045-mind-dream-purviews#post1022045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi guys!<br /> Does anyone know of a good and balanced Mind or Dream purview? Recently I've been reading Sandman and having some ideas, but nothing in Scion really gets where I want to go.<br /> Anyway, thanks beforehand, happy holidays!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Considering Purviews give you the freedom to invent your own boons, I like to imagine that there is a Psychopomp boon that allows you to step into the minds of others. <br /> <br /> The idea comes from Shrodinger from the Hellsing series, who's power is essentially <b>omnipresence</b>. He's exists everywhere and nowhere at the same time, including being inside the minds of other people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-27T11:12:55-08:00","id":1022851,"title":"","content":"I vaguely recall Neall saying that Darkness may have some dreamwalking powers<br /> <br /> Disclaimer: My memory can be spotty. It might have been Vance saying something, or a different Purview","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: In favor of fun and enjoyment, but may speak up to warn you that you're gonna step on a metaphorical land mine","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2142-kyman201","name":"Kyman201","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2142_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-27T13:44:58-08:00","id":1022933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1022045-mind-dream-purviews?p=1022851#post1022851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I vaguely recall Neall saying that Darkness may have some dreamwalking powers<br /> <br /> Disclaimer: My memory can be spotty. It might have been Vance saying something, or a different Purview</div> </div> </div> </div>Second Edition's Darkness Purview encompasses dreams, yeah.<br /> <br /> For Mind stuff, there's also Deception (ne\u00e9 Illusion) and Passion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-27T13:47:18-08:00","id":1022936,"title":"","content":"Would Sage have Knacks for being a super-teacher (i.e. granting mortals mind-expanding skill dots)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 12-27-2016, 05:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[